{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51042","headline":"酬刘侍御过草堂 · 吴筠","name":"酬刘侍御过草堂","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"畴昔隳世网，就闲栖远林。\n岂谓轩车客，来过涧壑深。\n既怀康济业，仍许隐沦心。\n灵液充甘饮，松风代鸣琴。\n晤言不可极，真兴何愔愔。\n贻我方来偈，自然生玉音。\n予慙乏琼玖，无以报兼金。\n他日思良会，含情时永吟。\n（见道士孟宗宝集虚编《洞霄诗集》。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吴筠","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51042.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51042","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}